    "notes": "All 9 final portable views inspected. Complete red-brick headhouse and projecting SSE annex, closed curved white canopy with upturned ends and central sail profile, pale mast and short antenna, red upper infill, closed red annex hip roof and pale fascia, narrow closed blue-gray openings and wide ribbed service shutter. The annex front is blank brick; its entrances are on the returns. Original approximate rear and side openings complete the exterior. Fixed the small gap below the crowned canopy ends during this same pass; all six models have a regression ray through that former slot. Platforms, railings, green forecourt gates, lettering, independent monument and mountain are outside the headhouse scope. No navigable interior or exact unseen opening inventory is claimed."
